.idea/
build/
local.properties
*.iml
app/build/
app/google-services.json

# app/schemas/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Room exports one JSON file per
# schema version there, and they are the record of how the database has changed.
# Committed, a migration can be tested against the real prior schema and an
# accidental schema change shows up in review as a modified file. Ignored, both
# of those disappear — and a wrong migration is the classic way an Android app
# destroys user data.

